WEBVTT

00:02.480 --> 00:04.690
<b>You didn't have to trouble 
yourself with coming here.</b>

00:04.690 --> 00:06.650
<b>I could have gone to you.</b>

00:07.030 --> 00:11.110
<b>I am somewhat responsible
for shoving Flat onto you.</b>

00:11.450 --> 00:13.430
<b>Honestly, the fact that you</b>

00:13.430 --> 00:15.870
<b>keep harboring him...
I am beyond admiration.</b>

00:15.870 --> 00:18.200
<b>I'm frankly dumbstruck.</b>

00:18.910 --> 00:24.170
<b>You said you were just going to stand by
and observe this Holy Grail War.</b>

00:24.170 --> 00:25.550
<b>But what will you do about Flat?</b>

00:25.840 --> 00:27.710
<b>I'd like to say it's 
outside my jurisdiction...</b>

00:28.130 --> 00:32.050
<b>but he is still one of my students.</b>

00:32.430 --> 00:35.260
<b>And the Holy Grail War 
happening over there...</b>

00:35.720 --> 00:39.350
<b>seems to have some 
strange things going on.</b>

00:39.350 --> 00:40.640
<b>Strange?</b>

00:40.640 --> 00:41.850
<b>No.</b>

00:42.270 --> 00:44.980
<b>Perhaps the Holy Grail War...</b>

00:45.400 --> 00:49.190
<b>hasn't even begun.</b>

00:49.690 --> 00:52.910
<b>The Overseer for the Holy Grail War?
How reprehensible.</b>

00:53.570 --> 00:55.830
<b>I rushed to join this war...</b>

00:55.830 --> 01:01.790
<b>because I heard the 
Church wasn't involved.</b>

01:01.790 --> 01:03.620
<b>But in the end, this city is also—</b>

01:04.080 --> 01:07.210
<b>You're too long-winded, damn corpse.</b>

01:08.090 --> 01:10.670
<b>What is the meaning of this?</b>

01:11.010 --> 01:13.000
<b>Mm... my treat.</b>

01:13.000 --> 01:16.010
<b>You should slurp it instead of
the blood of the guys around here.</b>

01:18.470 --> 01:21.930
<b>I see, I get it! Your treat!</b>

01:24.350 --> 01:28.440
<b>But this is the coffee they're handing out
for free at the information desk!</b>

01:32.700 --> 01:34.160
<b>Huh?</b>

01:45.880 --> 01:48.590
<b>I thought I would blow your head off.</b>

01:48.590 --> 01:50.340
<b>But it's certainly quite hard.</b>

01:50.630 --> 01:52.920
<b>A passing of the baton, so to speak.</b>

01:53.510 --> 01:55.430
<b>I'll get rid of him.</b>

01:55.970 --> 01:58.100
<b>Are you saying you're going to assist us?</b>

01:58.680 --> 02:02.230
<b>Before I am an Overseer, I'm a priest.</b>

02:02.560 --> 02:05.730
<b>But, well, there is something 
I want in return.</b>

02:05.730 --> 02:10.110
<b>Please keep how I just wasted
that coffee quiet from the Church.</b>

02:10.690 --> 02:13.990
<b>I'm scared of getting scolded by Father.</b>

03:44.580 --> 03:46.830
<b>I let my guard down.</b>

03:46.830 --> 03:48.080
<b>Yes.</b>

03:48.080 --> 03:50.330
<b>I let my guard down just now!</b>

03:50.670 --> 03:53.040
<b>This must be what people call "hubris"!</b>

03:54.130 --> 03:58.550
<b>Don't be so humble.
You didn't let your guard down.</b>

03:58.550 --> 04:00.930
<b>You always go full throttle, don't you?</b>

04:19.490 --> 04:21.950
<b>Are you an Executor?</b>

04:22.370 --> 04:24.700
<b>I'm taking a break from being an Executor.</b>

04:24.700 --> 04:27.120
<b>Today, I'm here as the Overseer.</b>

04:28.620 --> 04:30.460
<b>What a foolish choice!</b>

04:30.460 --> 04:36.460
<b>Defeating me means you are abandoning
your neutrality as Overseer!</b>

04:36.800 --> 04:42.180
<b>Oh? I didn't hear anything about you
being a Master of the Holy Grail War!</b>

04:42.180 --> 04:45.430
<b>I declared as such before 
Assassin just now!</b>

04:45.720 --> 04:49.390
<b>The Servant seemed like she wanted to deny
your entire existence, though, didn't she?</b>

04:50.060 --> 04:51.560
<b>That is part...</b>

04:51.560 --> 04:52.440
<b>of the beauty!</b>

04:55.770 --> 04:56.610
<b>Hah!</b>

04:56.610 --> 04:58.530
<b>That doesn't answer the question!</b>

05:06.620 --> 05:07.240
<b>Hmm?</b>

05:07.740 --> 05:08.700
<b>What's that?</b>

05:10.830 --> 05:12.500
<b>A Servant?</b>

05:14.040 --> 05:14.830
<b>That's...</b>

05:15.330 --> 05:16.710
<b>the priest from earlier.</b>

05:17.750 --> 05:18.670
<b>But the other one...</b>

05:19.130 --> 05:20.260
<b>Humph.</b>

05:21.220 --> 05:22.680
<b>No clue!</b>

05:24.140 --> 05:28.010
<b>I've no clue, but that's 
certainly not a Servant.</b>

05:28.390 --> 05:31.430
<b>Likely some sort of demon
or a type of apparition.</b>

05:31.980 --> 05:34.400
<b>However, that priest...</b>

05:35.150 --> 05:39.610
<b>With his body as it is, he has yet to
completely become a tool for his god?</b>

05:43.860 --> 05:46.030
<b>We have an audience, now!</b>

05:46.030 --> 05:48.580
<b>What happened to you concealing
the Holy Grail War?</b>

05:49.790 --> 05:52.410
<b>Something of this caliber
can be easily explained away.</b>

05:52.410 --> 05:53.210
<b>More importantly...</b>

05:53.750 --> 05:56.080
<b>if you can't hit me, 
I'll attack you, okay?</b>

06:09.430 --> 06:12.230
<b>Is this your job as Overseer?</b>

06:12.680 --> 06:16.230
<b>I am a Master, someone you lot
need to safeguard, you know!</b>

06:16.230 --> 06:22.320
<b>The Church interferes to conceal Mystics
and protect the tranquility of humanity.</b>

06:22.900 --> 06:26.020
<b>If a vampire were to get 
ahold of the Holy Grail,</b>

06:26.020 --> 06:28.160
<b>I'd be a failure of an Overseer, wouldn't I?</b>

06:38.420 --> 06:41.300
<b>I didn't realize
you wanted to kill me that much.</b>

06:41.300 --> 06:45.470
<b>Did a Dead Apostle kill your parents
or lover or something?</b>

06:45.470 --> 06:51.260
<b>Well, they killed off my entire clan,
but I don't really bear a grudge over it.</b>

06:51.600 --> 06:54.230
<b>No matter how I look at 
you, you're a villain.</b>

06:54.640 --> 06:56.600
<b>Are you dissatisfied with that reason?</b>

06:58.020 --> 07:01.900
<b>All of your words and actions irritate me.</b>

07:02.280 --> 07:04.800
<b>So, you're going to aimlessly
kill Dead Apostles</b>

07:04.800 --> 07:07.610
<b>without feeling any particular belief?</b>

07:08.110 --> 07:10.620
<b>Polar opposites from 
that elegant Assassin!</b>

07:10.620 --> 07:12.450
<b>How ugly!</b>

07:27.090 --> 07:28.220
<b>I'll take this!</b>

07:31.930 --> 07:33.430
<b>Damn you!</b>

07:33.720 --> 07:35.220
<b>You have a prosthetic hand?</b>

07:35.600 --> 07:38.940
<b>I have to deal with monsters 
like you after all.</b>

07:39.310 --> 07:42.650
<b>Seventy percent of my body is
made up of consecrated mechanical parts.</b>

07:46.570 --> 07:49.950
<b>That wind earlier... Is that your power?</b>

07:50.410 --> 07:52.280
<b>Sorry, but I'm a coward.</b>

07:53.120 --> 07:55.040
<b>I've no intentions
of sharing my grand insights!</b>

08:21.770 --> 08:23.230
<b>I see, I see.</b>

08:24.150 --> 08:28.190
<b>You're top tier among all 
the Executors I've seen!</b>

08:28.990 --> 08:33.070
<b>Perhaps you're part
of the much-rumored Burial Agency?</b>

08:33.700 --> 08:35.330
<b>Burial Agency?</b>

08:35.620 --> 08:37.160
<b>Me?</b>

08:38.410 --> 08:41.000
<b>This corpse is spouting nonsense.</b>

08:41.500 --> 08:44.000
<b>I am nowhere near them.</b>

08:44.000 --> 08:44.630
<b>No...</b>

08:45.040 --> 08:48.510
<b>I wouldn't dare be even placed
on the same plane as them!</b>

08:48.510 --> 08:49.720
<b>What?</b>

08:49.720 --> 08:51.470
<b>It's true that...</b>

08:51.470 --> 08:54.180
<b>I can inflict the same
amount of damage to you</b>

08:54.180 --> 08:56.720
<b>as nuclear missiles or chemical weapons!</b>

08:57.060 --> 09:01.890
<b>But... mere human weaponry
falls far short of such dignitaries!</b>

09:01.890 --> 09:04.570
<b>They execute the works of God Himself</b>

09:04.570 --> 09:08.030
<b>and annihilate evil
violating His territory!</b>

09:08.030 --> 09:12.490
<b>A comparison is nothing
but an insult to their name!</b>

09:14.200 --> 09:17.660
<b>You are a mere violation
to the realm of humanity.</b>

09:18.040 --> 09:20.290
<b>Thus, I will...</b>

09:20.290 --> 09:23.250
<b>annihilate you with the power of humans!</b>

09:23.750 --> 09:27.460
<b>I see. So, this is where things get real.</b>

09:28.090 --> 09:29.920
<b>But... it seems we're out of time.</b>

09:30.260 --> 09:32.760
<b>I'll leave it to an 
introduction for today.</b>

09:34.510 --> 09:35.930
<b>I'm not letting you escape.</b>

09:40.310 --> 09:43.190
<b>Too bad!</b>

09:44.150 --> 09:44.940
<b>Huh?</b>

10:01.040 --> 10:02.370
<b>Hey, boy!</b>

10:02.370 --> 10:03.710
<b>Did you see anything?</b>

10:04.040 --> 10:07.880
<b>A scary old man said, "Outta the way"...</b>

10:07.880 --> 10:09.300
<b>and everyone...</b>

10:09.300 --> 10:11.090
<b>Do you know which way he went?</b>

10:12.510 --> 10:13.420
<b>I see.</b>

10:13.880 --> 10:15.380
<b>I'm glad you're okay.</b>

10:15.380 --> 10:16.680
<b>You're safe now.</b>

10:17.930 --> 10:18.760
<b>It's me.</b>

10:18.760 --> 10:20.770
<b><i>All hands are to surround the building.</i></b>

10:20.770 --> 10:22.770
<b><i>He might try to mingle
among the evacuating crowd.</i></b>

10:23.180 --> 10:25.140
<b>Make sure to catch anyone suspicious.</b>

10:26.230 --> 10:28.520
<b>A Dead Apostle seeking the Holy Grail...</b>

10:28.940 --> 10:31.150
<b>This world really is coming to an end.</b>

10:34.450 --> 10:37.200
<b>I wonder if the police are all right.</b>

10:37.700 --> 10:38.910
<b>Yeah.</b>

10:38.910 --> 10:42.290
<b>There are many injured, but fortunately,
it seems there are no casualties.</b>

10:42.620 --> 10:44.160
<b>Please stop.</b>

10:45.210 --> 10:47.040
<b>I'm terribly sorry...</b>

10:47.040 --> 10:50.670
<b>but I was told to check out any suspicious
individuals in the surrounding area.</b>

10:50.670 --> 10:54.300
<b>GLOOM</b>

10:51.000 --> 10:54.300
<b>Well... you look a ton more suspicious.</b>

10:56.090 --> 10:56.760
<b>Huh?</b>

10:59.930 --> 11:02.680
<b>They're burning incense 
for group hypnosis.</b>

11:03.270 --> 11:06.890
<b>The Church is trying to conceal that
battle against the Dead Apostle, right?</b>

11:07.190 --> 11:10.230
<b>So, you are a Servant and his Master.</b>

11:10.230 --> 11:11.400
<b>Apologies for my rudeness.</b>

11:11.860 --> 11:13.280
<b>Dead Apostle?</b>

11:13.280 --> 11:17.150
<b>Basically, what your 
society calls a "vampire."</b>

11:17.150 --> 11:19.240
<b>There's the likes of those, too?</b>

11:19.700 --> 11:22.660
<b>I don't want to get roped
into something troublesome.</b>

11:22.660 --> 11:24.370
<b>I'll be going now.</b>

11:24.370 --> 11:26.210
<b>Right. Let's get going!</b>

11:26.500 --> 11:28.250
<b>You don't have to come with me.</b>

11:28.250 --> 11:31.130
<b>Please come to the Central Church
when you have a moment.</b>

11:31.670 --> 11:35.510
<b>The Overseer has something
to talk about with Masters.</b>

11:36.090 --> 11:38.630
<b>I'm sorry, but I'm not a Master.</b>

11:43.600 --> 11:45.220
<b><i>What in the world...</i></b>

11:46.020 --> 11:48.600
<b><i>am I supposed to do in this city?</i></b>

11:49.690 --> 11:50.690
<b>Huh?</b>

11:51.060 --> 11:53.230
<b>If it ain't that girl from the other day!</b>

11:53.230 --> 11:53.900
<b>Oh...</b>

11:55.280 --> 11:56.490
<b>Hey!</b>

11:57.740 --> 11:58.990
<b>Damages?</b>

11:59.320 --> 12:01.160
<b>No injuries among the civilians.</b>

12:01.700 --> 12:04.790
<b>Several Clan Calatin were injured.
Currently undergoing treatment.</b>

12:07.080 --> 12:08.750
<b>You shouldn't overexert yourself.</b>

12:08.750 --> 12:10.460
<b>We can take care of the rest.</b>

12:10.790 --> 12:13.290
<b>No, I'll keep going! Please allow me to!</b>

12:13.670 --> 12:15.250
<b>With those wounds?</b>

12:15.250 --> 12:16.760
<b>You still have a future ahead of you.</b>

12:17.340 --> 12:19.720
<b>You shouldn't needlessly let that go.</b>

12:20.510 --> 12:22.090
<b>But I...</b>

12:22.430 --> 12:24.720
<b>I want to protect the future of this city!</b>

12:24.720 --> 12:27.520
<b>Is there anything to guarantee
you won't just be a liability?</b>

12:28.600 --> 12:29.850
<b>Well...</b>

12:30.480 --> 12:32.630
<b>if the only opponent we were
facing were Servants,</b>

12:32.630 --> 12:34.690
<b>I may have been able to resign myself.</b>

12:35.150 --> 12:38.400
<b>However, if we leave
such corrupt individuals like him be...</b>

12:38.690 --> 12:40.740
<b>what will happen to this city?</b>

12:41.110 --> 12:42.870
<b>This isn't about me as a Mage.</b>

12:42.870 --> 12:44.660
<b>I can't stand by and watch
as a police officer!</b>

12:45.200 --> 12:47.200
<b>I accept the ardor.</b>

12:47.200 --> 12:50.870
<b>But I can't allow a diehard
to expose everyone to danger.</b>

12:51.290 --> 12:53.880
<b>If you're saying you can still fight...</b>

12:53.880 --> 12:58.130
<b>prove that you can handle a weapon
with one arm or with a prosthetic hand...</b>

12:58.130 --> 12:59.970
<b>John Wingard.</b>

13:00.590 --> 13:02.090
<b>I'll do it!</b>

13:04.140 --> 13:04.930
<b>It's me.</b>

13:04.930 --> 13:07.890
<b><i>Hey, Brother! What a misfortune!</i></b>

13:07.890 --> 13:09.890
<b><i>To think that was a vampire!</i></b>

13:10.310 --> 13:12.940
<b>Surprised even me!</b>

13:12.940 --> 13:17.150
<b>That said, you got a package
from a guy named Shishigou.</b>

13:17.150 --> 13:19.740
<b>With this thing, I think you
can get to the heart</b>

13:19.740 --> 13:21.860
<b>of your opponent even if he's a vampire.</b>

13:22.280 --> 13:23.990
<b>I'll make it...</b>

13:23.990 --> 13:26.580
<b>for that young lad that got injured.</b>

13:27.080 --> 13:30.790
<b>Using this Hydra poison 
dagger as the base.</b>

13:31.330 --> 13:33.040
<b>Looking forward to it.</b>

13:34.080 --> 13:35.710
<b>I'm leaving you in charge here.</b>

13:35.710 --> 13:36.750
<b>Where to?</b>

13:37.250 --> 13:40.920
<b>I have to question the superiors.
If, under these conditions...</b>

13:41.340 --> 13:45.180
<b>they're still going to start
the <i>other </i>war as planned.</b>

13:54.440 --> 13:56.190
<b>I hope the young lady Assassin...</b>

13:56.190 --> 13:58.940
<b>comes back soon.</b>

14:03.070 --> 14:06.370
<b><i>We will bring you more coverage on the
terrorist attack near the police station</i></b>

14:06.370 --> 14:08.410
<b><i>as information comes in.</i></b>

14:09.080 --> 14:10.330
<b><i>Up next...</i></b>

14:10.330 --> 14:13.710
<b>My goodness, that Servant
who was giving a speech...</b>

14:13.710 --> 14:16.630
<b>Wasn't his charisma through 
the roof, Mr. Jack?</b>

14:17.590 --> 14:20.350
<b>I must say, calling out my
True Name so publicly</b>

14:20.350 --> 14:22.590
<b>is rather concerning. More than that...</b>

14:23.380 --> 14:24.920
<b>if that is your impression of seeing</b>

14:24.920 --> 14:26.930
<b>a Heroic Spirit that
you should antagonize...</b>

14:26.930 --> 14:29.470
<b>it gives me doubts about you as a Master.</b>

14:29.470 --> 14:31.060
<b>I've been telling you,
we're not going to antagonize anyone!</b>

14:31.470 --> 14:33.560
<b>We can all be friends!</b>

14:33.980 --> 14:37.520
<b>I'm more and more uncertain
whether you understand...</b>

14:37.520 --> 14:39.270
<b>the meaning behind the Holy Grail War.</b>

14:39.610 --> 14:44.280
<b>It's fine! I made sure to take a picture
of the Dead Apostle person!</b>

14:44.280 --> 14:45.990
<b>This is valuable!</b>

14:45.990 --> 14:49.280
<b>Everyone else was forced to erase
any pictures because of the hypnosis!</b>

14:49.280 --> 14:51.950
<b>Please use your phone 
quietly in the store!</b>

14:51.950 --> 14:53.500
<b>Oh, I'm sorry.</b>

14:54.000 --> 14:57.630
<b>What do you mean,
the Holy Grail War hasn't started yet?</b>

14:57.630 --> 15:00.430
<b>I only have fragmented information,</b>

15:00.430 --> 15:03.170
<b>but it seems that the United States
is starting something...</b>

15:03.170 --> 15:05.300
<b>behind the scenes of the war.</b>

15:05.760 --> 15:09.260
<b>I gained this intel from a Mage
who has snuck into Snowfield.</b>

15:09.680 --> 15:12.720
<b>Most likely the doings of a Heroic Spirit.</b>

15:13.100 --> 15:18.100
<b>It's proof that multiple powerful Servants
have been summoned.</b>

15:18.100 --> 15:19.610
<b>However, in the past few hours...</b>

15:19.610 --> 15:21.650
<b>the Leyline in Snowfield is once again</b>

15:21.650 --> 15:24.440
<b>showing an abnormal swell in Magical Energy.</b>

15:25.780 --> 15:31.160
<b>Despite the Heroic Spirits being summoned,
it is absorbing Magical Energy once again?</b>

15:31.530 --> 15:33.120
<b>Exactly.</b>

15:33.120 --> 15:36.620
<b>I just received additional data
from my collaborator.</b>

15:36.960 --> 15:40.080
<b>This seems to be footage from a TV show
from a local station over there.</b>

15:40.080 --> 15:44.340
<b>You say it's out of your jurisdiction,
but you really are a worrywart.</b>

15:46.970 --> 15:49.090
<b>I'm finally done!</b>

15:49.090 --> 15:52.470
<b>I can finally contact
my professor now, Mr. Jack!</b>

15:52.470 --> 15:56.980
<b>Seeking advice from your mentor
for surviving the Holy Grail War?</b>

15:57.390 --> 16:00.980
<b>More like, there's something strange
about this city.</b>

16:01.520 --> 16:04.940
<b>There are illusions using Magecraft
quietly set up throughout the city.</b>

16:05.530 --> 16:07.650
<b>And there's a strange fog drifting around.</b>

16:08.070 --> 16:09.160
<b>Fog?</b>

16:09.160 --> 16:13.700
<b>Besides, knowing my professor,
I'm sure he's really worried.</b>

16:13.700 --> 16:17.120
<b>And I want to inform him about you
more than anything, Mr. Jack!</b>

16:18.790 --> 16:19.580
<b>And...</b>

16:20.250 --> 16:24.670
<b>I wanted to ask how I can become friends
with the other Servants.</b>

16:24.670 --> 16:28.170
<b>I took a picture of one other Servant
back at the police station.</b>

16:28.170 --> 16:29.550
<b>H-Hold on a second there!</b>

16:30.340 --> 16:32.600
<b>What do you mean, another Servant?</b>

16:32.600 --> 16:33.890
<b>Oh, right.</b>

16:33.890 --> 16:36.320
<b>Your attention was glued to the battle between</b>

16:36.320 --> 16:38.240
<b>the priest and the Dead Apostle,
so you didn't notice.</b>

16:38.240 --> 16:40.190
<b>Why didn't you say something?</b>

16:40.190 --> 16:41.520
<b>Well, I mean...</b>

16:42.150 --> 16:45.730
<b>if I kicked up a fuss and he noticed,
I'd likely have been killed in an instant.</b>

16:46.650 --> 16:47.820
<b>What?</b>

16:48.190 --> 16:52.280
<b>I've never seen such an amazing
cluster of energy like that.</b>

16:53.070 --> 16:56.620
<b>I think I'd be dead meat
the moment they noticed.</b>

16:57.700 --> 17:00.370
<b>I thought you just a fool...</b>

17:00.670 --> 17:02.880
<b>yet you are practical 
in the strangest way.</b>

17:02.880 --> 17:06.000
<b>You thought I was just a fool until now?</b>

17:06.000 --> 17:07.340
<b>Are you angry?</b>

17:07.670 --> 17:10.340
<b>No, I'm actually kind of happy instead.</b>

17:10.880 --> 17:15.880
<b>From when I was a child, people were
scared of me and avoided me all the time.</b>

17:15.880 --> 17:18.930
<b>There were few
who'd actually scold me to my face.</b>

17:18.930 --> 17:19.930
<b>I see.</b>

17:20.350 --> 17:21.770
<b>The only people that would...</b>

17:21.770 --> 17:24.940
<b>were my professor,
his little sister the princess...</b>

17:24.940 --> 17:28.690
<b>everyone in my class, also the alumni.</b>

17:30.440 --> 17:33.740
<b>No, wait. Isn't that quite a few?</b>

17:34.070 --> 17:36.280
<b><i>Huh? Is this TV?</i></b>

17:37.290 --> 17:40.000
<b><i>Wow! I wonder if the professor
and Reines are watching this!</i></b>

17:40.000 --> 17:41.460
<b>Both mentor and apprentice...</b>

17:42.080 --> 17:45.460
<b>join the Holy Grail War, sneaking
behind the backs of their professors.</b>

17:46.420 --> 17:49.800
<b>I guess recklessness
is part of what is being taught.</b>

17:49.800 --> 17:51.970
<b>I have no words of rebuttal.</b>

17:53.510 --> 17:54.930
<b>Excuse me.</b>

17:55.340 --> 17:56.970
<b><i>Hi, Professor!</i></b>

17:56.970 --> 17:58.220
<b><i>Thanks to you,</i></b>

17:58.220 --> 18:01.020
<b><i>I was able to summon the 
best Heroic Spirit ever!</i></b>

18:01.020 --> 18:03.640
<b><i>Say hello to the one and only Berserker!</i></b>

18:05.230 --> 18:07.520
<b>You ingenious idiot.</b>

18:09.690 --> 18:12.070
<b><i>Here's a picture of the Heroic Spirit
I saw in the city!</i></b>

18:12.360 --> 18:14.740
<b><i>What should I do to befriend them?</i></b>

18:20.700 --> 18:22.460
<b>Impossible!</b>

18:25.000 --> 18:25.630
<b>Hah!</b>

18:26.250 --> 18:30.050
<b>Even simply comparing how
the streets and buildings are lined up...</b>

18:30.050 --> 18:32.470
<b>the city of Uruk is more beautiful!</b>

18:32.880 --> 18:34.050
<b>My king...</b>

18:34.050 --> 18:35.970
<b>I hear that the Holy Grail Wars of yore</b>

18:35.970 --> 18:39.430
<b>had cases where entire
buildings were annihilated.</b>

18:39.890 --> 18:42.560
<b>They may come to destroy
the Crystal Hill entirely, too.</b>

18:42.560 --> 18:46.020
<b>That is not even an issue for me.</b>

18:46.400 --> 18:49.650
<b>However, I am the one
who beckoned you here.</b>

18:49.650 --> 18:52.530
<b>I will make a special case
and at least get you a parachute.</b>

18:52.530 --> 18:53.440
<b>O-Okay.</b>

18:54.150 --> 18:55.610
<b>So, Tiné...</b>

18:55.990 --> 18:58.410
<b>You want to regain this land, do you not?</b>

18:58.950 --> 19:00.490
<b>Of course!</b>

19:01.290 --> 19:03.790
<b>Then wouldn't it be the fastest...</b>

19:03.790 --> 19:08.960
<b>to take this mediocre scenery
and clear the land, usurpers and all?</b>

19:12.210 --> 19:13.760
<b>S-Surely you joke.</b>

19:14.380 --> 19:15.760
<b>A joke?</b>

19:15.760 --> 19:19.260
<b>That is the closest answer
to what your ancestors eagerly wished for, right?</b>

19:19.640 --> 19:22.640
<b>What difference is there
between the lives of the clown...</b>

19:22.640 --> 19:25.270
<b>who first summoned me
and the mongrels of this city?</b>

19:26.230 --> 19:31.360
<b>Committing such savagery will make us the
same as the Mages who pilfered this land.</b>

19:31.940 --> 19:33.440
<b>A model answer.</b>

19:33.730 --> 19:34.780
<b>But that's not enough.</b>

19:36.950 --> 19:39.950
<b>That is not a solution that you personally
came up with yourself, now is it...</b>

19:40.620 --> 19:42.120
<b>Tiné Chelc?</b>

19:42.450 --> 19:44.540
<b>Personally?</b>

19:46.080 --> 19:48.790
<b>You finally have doubt.</b>

19:48.790 --> 19:50.500
<b>Then all is well.</b>

19:50.960 --> 19:52.130
<b>Huh?</b>

19:52.130 --> 19:55.800
<b>Doubt is the foundation
by which you break through blind faith.</b>

19:56.220 --> 19:56.840
<b>Worry not...</b>

19:57.590 --> 20:00.930
<b>it was because you had
such a depressed look on your face.</b>

20:00.930 --> 20:02.810
<b>I was merely teasing you a bit.</b>

20:04.350 --> 20:05.520
<b>What's wrong?</b>

20:05.810 --> 20:08.500
<b>Have you finally realized
that the most supreme</b>

20:08.500 --> 20:11.560
<b>recreation in this world
is to behold my glory?</b>

20:11.560 --> 20:13.320
<b>It is fine, I shall allow it!</b>

20:13.320 --> 20:18.700
<b>Gaze upon me to your heart's content,
then pass the story down the generations!</b>

20:27.200 --> 20:28.410
<b>That is a Saber!</b>

20:29.120 --> 20:30.330
<b>This cannot be!</b>

20:30.790 --> 20:32.290
<b>Indeed.</b>

20:32.630 --> 20:36.210
<b>I've never heard of a Heroic Spirit
who gives a speech on TV.</b>

20:36.210 --> 20:37.340
<b>That's not it.</b>

20:37.920 --> 20:41.320
<b>The land started emitting Magical Energy</b>

20:41.320 --> 20:44.310
<b>at about the same time
as this live broadcast.</b>

20:44.310 --> 20:45.060
<b>It's as if...</b>

20:45.430 --> 20:48.640
<b>the Holy Grail is starting
to summon seven Heroic Spirits.</b>

20:49.270 --> 20:50.440
<b>What?</b>

20:50.440 --> 20:55.230
<b>The States had called this
a "Fake Holy Grail War."</b>

20:55.570 --> 20:58.490
<b>Six Servants, with no Saber.</b>

20:58.490 --> 21:00.910
<b>I didn't understand what 
they meant by that.</b>

21:00.910 --> 21:02.200
<b>It can't be!</b>

21:03.370 --> 21:05.450
<b>Is this Saber the first one?</b>

21:06.080 --> 21:09.610
<b>If the six already summoned
were only catalysts</b>

21:09.610 --> 21:12.000
<b>for the actual rituals to be held...</b>

21:14.880 --> 21:16.210
<b>It's time.</b>

21:18.460 --> 21:20.380
<b><i>For the elements, silver and iron.</i></b>

21:20.800 --> 21:23.390
<b><i>For the foundation, stone
and the Archduke of Contracts.</i></b>

21:23.760 --> 21:27.720
<b>...new Heroic Spirits
will be summoned to Snowfield!</b>

21:28.020 --> 21:29.810
<b><i>Come forth from the circle of binding...</i></b>

21:30.310 --> 21:32.400
<b><i>Guardian of the Scales!</i></b>

21:42.280 --> 21:43.450
<b>Huh?</b>

21:46.200 --> 21:47.700
<b>It failed?</b>

21:51.620 --> 21:52.960
<b>It's me.</b>

21:53.330 --> 21:54.880
<b>Yes, it was a failure.</b>

21:55.170 --> 21:58.130
<b>Ultimately, seven of them is the limit
for materializing at the same time—</b>

22:07.470 --> 22:09.970
<b>EPISODE 3</b>
